{
 "what": "nemotron-3-diarization (NVIDIA Nemotron-3-Diarization, onnx-community int8 ONNX, run by bolo's NumPy front-end and chunk loop in ONNX Runtime) against pyannote-3.0-eres2net (sherpa-onnx clustering, bolo's defaults): front-end and probability checks against transformers' PyTorch reference, DER components, speaker counts, cpWER of diarized whisper-base transcripts, speed",
 "date": "2026-11-13",
 "conditions": "4 vCPU Xeon @ 2.1 GHz (AVX-512), no GPU, 2 threads, shared with other evaluation jobs; onnxruntime 1.31.1, sherpa-onnx 2.0.1; reference: transformers 5.23.0 with PyTorch 2.15 CPU, fp32",
